    "addd98d5-c1fe-4903-a0c7-b3c15e10268d": {
      "type": "founder-text-section",
      "settings": {
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "subtitle": "OUR PLEDGE",
        "title": "We believe in transparency. As an advocate for diamond mining communities, global societies and the Earth, we are putting a modern twist on an outdated industry.",
        "text": "<p>We pledge to only use ethically-sourced materials to craft your conflict-free jewelry. By using sustainable practices, we are able to push for a more socially responsible diamond industry.</p>"
      }
    },
    "6a5434af-a74b-4e22-8558-5e51c45b2cae": {
      "type": "our-pledge_image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "22108ee1-df25-46dd-9de8-c7fe0fce108a": {
          "type": "Image",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "left",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/diamond-mining-communities_e5013fe3-4ddd-4066-80bc-5a83b9a982ac.jpg",
            "title": "DIAMOND MINING COMMUNITIES",
            "description": "<p>Traditional earth-mined diamonds fund wars, damage economies and contribute to the killing, maiming and displacing of innocent people. As a MiaDonna consumer, you directly contribute to the funding of\n <a class=\"pink-text\" href=\"http://thegreenerdiamond.org/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Greener Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Greener Diamond</a> projects that empower and restore these diamond mining communities.</p>"
          }
        },
        "efd4da50-ea5e-492a-bde5-1a89ca1fbecd": {
          "type": "Image",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "right",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/global-societies.webp",
            "title": "GLOBAL SOCIETIES",
            "description": "<p>We don't answer to shareholders, board members, mining companies, or corporations. As a social enterprise, our goal is to improve the quality of living for global societies.</p>\n<p>As a shopper, you have the choice to buy ethically. We make it easy for you to find a product you not only love but one with a mission you can stand by. With your purchase, not only will you feel good but you’ll do good too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "847fbb92-131b-4098-a28f-c964b9bbf164": {
          "type": "Image",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "left",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/the-earth_72d54c2e-9551-4972-98dc-17962dd002c0.jpg",
            "title": "THE EARTH",
            "description": "<p>Mining is both catastrophic for local community members and the environment. Each year, more than 150 million carats of diamonds are extracted from the Earth resulting in the removal and displacement of enormous amounts of soil. Additionally, these mining efforts create irreversible damage to ecosystems.</p>\n<p>In this day and age, there is no longer a need to mine for precious gemstones or metals. Our products are crafted only from conflict-free diamonds and gemstones and recycled precious metals.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
